    "detailed_description": "Awakening on a rainy night, I wonder: Who am I? Where am I? <br>One thing is clear: I must press onward.<br><strong>The game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A connected, Metroidvania\u2010style world<br></li><li>Real-time combat, platforming, and puzzle\u2010solving stages<br></li><li>Six distinct themed regions<br></li><li>Ten epic bosses<br></li><li>Dozens of power-up items\u2014no choices required; master them all<br></li><li>Dozens of enemies with unique abilities (they\u2019re all peace-loving foods\u2014there must be some misunderstanding\u2026)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Awakening on a rainy night, I wonder: Who am I? Where am I? <br>One thing is clear: I must press onward.<br><strong>The game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A connected, Metroidvania\u2010style world<br></li><li>Real-time combat, platforming, and puzzle\u2010solving stages<br></li><li>Six distinct themed regions<br></li><li>Ten epic bosses<br></li><li>Dozens of power-up items\u2014no choices required; master them all<br></li><li>Dozens of enemies with unique abilities (they\u2019re all peace-loving foods\u2014there must be some misunderstanding\u2026)</li></ul>",
